+---
+id: task-004-bulk-import-of-tasks
+type: task
+title: "Bulk import of tasks"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, for bulk import.
+
+- `text` holds one task per line as `title;priority;tags`; an empty priority means normal, tags are
+  separated by spaces, blank lines are skipped.
+- Every valid line is added to the list. It returns `{ imported, rejected }`: `imported` counts the
+  tasks added, `rejected` lists each line not added as `{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1
+  (blank lines count).
+- A line is rejected with the list's own message (empty or long title, unknown priority, bad tag,
+  duplicate title, including a duplicate within the text), or when it has more than three fields.
+  A rejected line changes nothing; the other lines are still imported.
